<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> a djr:Document ;
    skos:prefLabel "discipline-tdd-final"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s001> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "# TDD 개발 방법론 가이드"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s001/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b17> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2100 ;
    djr:text "\n> 이 문서에서 “테스트 작성”이나 Red를 말하는 모든 절은 §5.5의 영구 테스트 입장 심사에서\n> `add`·`update`로 결정된 행을 전제로 한다. 요구·버그·피라미드·예제는 먼저 candidate일 뿐이며,\n> `reuse`·`reject`에서는 새 test artifact를 만들지 않는다.\n\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s006-2.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 2.1 기본 사이클 [테스트주도 개발]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "2.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s006-2.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s006-2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2101, djr:R-2102, djr:R-2103 ;
    djr:text "\n```\nRed   --> `add/update`로 승인된 작은 테스트가 실패하는 것을 확인한다\nGreen --> 테스트를 통과시키기 위해 최소한의 코드를 작성한다\nRefactor --> 중복을 제거하고 코드를 정리한다\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s006-2.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s006-2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "상세 단계:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s006-2.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s006-2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2104, djr:R-2105 ;
    djr:text "1. **승인된 테스트를 작성한다** -- §5.5의 `add/update` 행이 오퍼레이션을 코드에 어떤 식으로 나타내길 원하는지 생각해보라. 이야기를 써내려가는 것이다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s006-2.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s006-2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2106, djr:R-2107, djr:R-2108 ;
    djr:text "2. **실행 가능하게 만든다** -- 빨리 초록 막대를 보는 것이 가장 중요하다. 깔끔한 해법이 명백히 보인다면 그것을 입력하라. 몇 분 걸릴 것 같으면 일단 적어 놓은 뒤에 원래 문제(초록 막대를 보는 것)로 돌아오자\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s006-2.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s006-2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2109, djr:R-2110 ;
    djr:text "3. **올바르게 만든다** -- 시스템이 작동하므로 직전에 저질렀던 죄악을 수습하자. 중복을 제거하고 초록 막대로 되돌리자\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s006-2.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s006-2.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2111 ;
    djr:text "핵심: '작동하는 깔끔한 코드'에서 **작동하는 것부터 먼저 해결**하는 나누어서 정복하는(divide and conquer) 방식이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s012-3.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 3.4 실전 권고: 상황별 선택"@ko ;
