<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s012-3.4/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s012-3.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "| 복잡한 알고리즘 구현 | Inside-Out (고전 학파) |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s012-3.4/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s012-3.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s036-7.6/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2112 ;
    djr:text "> 이 표는 배경 지식이다 — 이 저장소의 기본은 고전 학파이고 Mock 은 외부 의존성 격리에만 쓴다(§7.6).\n\n"@ko .

