<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s015-4.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 4.2 회귀 방지의 위상 [Khorikov]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "4.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s015-4.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s015-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2113, djr:R-2114 ;
    djr:text "\n회귀 방지(Protection against Regressions)는 단순히 버그 발견 시 사후에 작성하는 회귀 테스트를 넘어, **모든 테스트가 처음부터 갖춰야 할 설계 원칙**이다. 테스트 설계 시점부터 \"이 테스트가 향후 회귀를 얼마나 잘 방지하는가\"를 고려해야 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s015-4.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s015-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b12>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b2> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2115, djr:R-2116 ;
    djr:text "실전 적용: 시스템 장애가 보고되면 먼저 §5.5의 candidate로 두고 승인 계약·독자 production failure·기존 권위 coverage를 확인한다. 기존 테스트가 같은 failure를 잡으면 `reuse`하고, 그렇지 않아 `add/update`로 입장된 경우에만 그 장애로 실패하고 통과하면 수정됐다고 볼 수 있는 테스트를 작성한다. [테스트주도 개발]\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s015-4.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s015-4.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "```python\ndef test_division_by_zero_returns_error():\n    \"\"\"버그 리포트 #42: 0으로 나눌 때 ZeroDivisionError 대신 None 반환됨\"\"\"\n    with pytest.raises(ZeroDivisionError):\n        divide(10, 0)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s018-4.5> a djr:Section ;
