    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s018-4.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "|--------|----------|:---------:|:-----------:|:---------:|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s018-4.5/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s018-4.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "| **출력 기반** (Output-based) | 반환값 | 높음 | 높음 | 높음 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s018-4.5/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s018-4.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "| **상태 기반** (State-based) | 객체 상태 | 높음 | 높음 | 중간 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s018-4.5/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s018-4.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "| **통신 기반** (Communication-based) | 메서드 호출 | 중간 | 낮음 | 낮음 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s018-4.5/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s018-4.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s036-7.6/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2117 ;
    djr:text "Khorikov의 권고: **출력 기반 > 상태 기반 > 통신 기반** 순으로 선호하라. 가능하면 비즈니스 로직을 순수 함수로 추출하여 출력 기반 테스트를 극대화하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s018-4.5/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s018-4.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# === 출력 기반 테스트 (가장 권장) ===\ndef calculate_discount(price: float, is_vip: bool) -> float:\n    \"\"\"순수 함수: 부수효과 없이 입력만으로 출력 결정.\"\"\"\n    return price * 0.8 if is_vip else price\n\n\ndef test_output_based():\n    \"\"\"SUT의 반환값만 검증한다. 가장 리팩토링에 강하다.\"\"\"\n    assert calculate_discount(1000, is_vip=True) == 800.0\n    assert calculate_discount(1000, is_vip=False) == 1000.0\n\n\n# === 상태 기반 테스트 ===\nclass ShoppingCart:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.items: list[str] = []\n\n    def add(self, item: str) -> None:\n        self.items.append(item)\n\n\ndef test_state_based():\n    \"\"\"행위 실행 후 SUT의 상태를 검증한다.\"\"\"\n    cart = ShoppingCart()\n    cart.add(\"사과\")\n\n    assert cart.items == [\"사과\"]  # 상태 검증\n\n\n# === 통신 기반 테스트 ===\ndef test_communication_based(mocker):\n    \"\"\"SUT가 협력 객체에 보내는 메시지를 검증한다.\"\"\"\n    mock_sender = mocker.Mock()\n    service = NotificationService(mock_sender)\n\n    service.notify(\"user@test.com\", \"안녕하세요\")\n\n    mock_sender.send.assert_called_once_with(\"user@test.com\", \"안녕하세요\")\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s021-5.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.1 테스트 후보 목록"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s021-5.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s021-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b2> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2118, djr:R-2119, djr:R-2120 ;
    djr:text "\n시작하기 전에 검토할 **테스트 후보 목록을 적어 둘 것**. 이 목록은 탐색 메모이지 test file·case·assertion·helper 작성 의무가 아니다. 각 후보는 §5.5의 영구 테스트 입장 심사를 통과한 `add`·`update`일 때만 Red가 된다. 테스트 코드는 테스트 대상이 되는 코드를 작성하기 직전에 작성하는 것이 좋다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s021-5.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s021-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2121, djr:R-2122, djr:R-2123 ;
    djr:text "후보 목록은 대표 예시만 나열하는 메모가 아니라, 입장 심사할 행위와 정책의 경계를 드러내는 검토 목록이다. 사용자가 경계 예시를 하나만 말했더라도 그 예시가 전체 후보 범위를 닫는 것은 아니다. 할인율, 최소 주문 금액, 수량 제한, 유효 기간처럼 결과가 바뀌는 경계가 있으면, 경계 자체와 결과가 달라지는 가장 가까운 바깥쪽 값 또는 보완 상태를 후보로 함께 적는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s021-5.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s021-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2124, djr:R-2125, djr:R-2126 ;
    djr:text "여러 독립 결정축이 결합된 정책에서는 각 축의 허용 사례와 거부 사례를 분리한다. 예를 들어 쿠폰 정책에서 만료일, 사용 여부, 활성 상태, 최소 주문 금액이 각각 결과를 바꾼다면 \"이미 사용됨\" 거부 사례가 \"만료일 다음 날\" 거부 사례를 대신하지 않는다. 유효 기간이 포함형이면 마지막 유효일은 허용 사례로, 그 다음 날은 거부 사례로 테스트 목록에 남긴다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s021-5.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s021-5.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "```python\ndef test_coupon_accepts_on_expiration_day():\n    coupon = Coupon(expires_on=date(2026, 5, 21))\n    assert coupon.can_apply(today=date(2026, 5, 21)) is True\n\n\ndef test_coupon_rejects_day_after_expiration():\n    coupon = Coupon(expires_on=date(2026, 5, 21))\n    assert coupon.can_apply(today=date(2026, 5, 22)) is False\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s022-5.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.2 한 단계 테스트"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s022-5.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s022-5.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2127, djr:R-2128 ;
    djr:text "\n목록에서 다음 테스트를 고를 때 기준: **새로운 무언가를 가르쳐 줄 수 있으며, 구현할 수 있다는 확신이 드는 테스트**를 고른다. 아는 것에서 모르는 것으로 방향을 잡는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s023-5.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.3 시작 테스트"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s023-5.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s023-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2129, djr:R-2130 ;
    djr:text "\n오퍼레이션이 **아무 일도 하지 않는 경우를 먼저 테스트**한다. 뭔가를 가르쳐 줄 수 있으면서도 빠르게 구현할 수 있는 테스트를 선택하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s023-5.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s023-5.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\ndef test_empty_cart_total():\n    cart = ShoppingCart()\n    assert cart.total() == 0  # 가장 단순한 경우부터 시작\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s024-5.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.4 설명 테스트"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s024-5.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s024-5.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2131 ;
    djr:text "\n자동화된 테스트가 널리 쓰이게 하려면 **테스트를 통해 설명을 요청하고, 테스트를 통해 설명**해야 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 5.5 영구 테스트 입장 심사와 현행 계약 수명 주기"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "5.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2132, djr:R-2133, djr:R-2134 ;
    djr:text "\n영구 테스트의 오라클은 현재 구현이 아니라 **현재 승인된 요구·설계·지원 계약**이다. 현재 구현과 기존 테스트는 조사 증거일 뿐이다. 구현이 현재 계약을 어기면 올바른 실패 테스트를 구현에 맞춰 삭제·약화하지 않고 구현을 고친다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2142 ;
    djr:text "- `add`: 독자적인 production failure를 보호할 새 영구 테스트를 만든다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2143 ;
    djr:text "- `update`: 승인된 계약 변경에 맞춰 지정된 기존 테스트의 의미를 갱신한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b12> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 12 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2144, djr:R-2145 ;
    djr:text "- `reuse`: 기존 권위 테스트가 같은 제품 failure를 이미 잡고 후보가 독자적인 failure mechanism을 제시하지 못하므로 새 테스트를 만들지 않는다. 테스트 boundary가 달라도 이 조건이면 `reuse`다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b13> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 13 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2146 ;
    djr:text "- `retain`: 관련 기존 테스트의 현행 보호 의미를 유지한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b14> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 14 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2147 ;
    djr:text "- `remove`: 명시적인 계약 종료 근거에 따라 지정된 기존 assertion/test만 제거한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b15> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 15 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2148 ;
    djr:text "- `reject`: framework/private/test-tool mechanics 또는 권위 있는 제품 계약이 없는 비자격 후보이므로 영구 테스트로 만들지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b16> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 16 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2149 ;
    djr:text "- `pending`: 근거·계약·중복 여부가 불명확해 사용자 또는 설계 결정이 필요하다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b17> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 17 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2150, djr:R-2151, djr:R-2152, djr:R-2153, djr:R-2154 ;
    djr:text "`pending`은 G1/G1′ 승인과 Phase 2 완료를 막는다(G1/G1′=파이프라인 설계 승인 게이트 · Phase 2=구현 국면 — Coordinator 게이트 명칭). `reuse`·`reject`에서는 새 test file·case·assertion·helper를 포함한 test artifact write가 0이다. `retain`의 의미 보존 move/split/rename/reorganization은 새 case·assertion·Red를 만들지 않고 전후에 같은 계약과 failure를 보호해야 한다. 재조직이 없으면 기존 artifact를 건드리지 않는다. `remove`는 새 명세의 침묵이나 현재 구현과의 불일치만으로 선택하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b18> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 18 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2155 ;
    djr:text "영구 테스트가 보호할 수 있는 대상은 다음과 같다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b19> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 19 ;
    djr:text "- 외부 HTTP·이벤트·영속 wire, 사용자 관찰 상태, 보안·개인정보·규제 계약\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2135, djr:R-2136 ;
    djr:text "영구 test artifact를 `add/update/move/split/rename/remove/weaken`하거나 의미 보존 재조직하기 전에 다음 최소 행을 확정한다. 후보 목록·테스트 피라미드·coverage·과거 버그·상위 테스트 실패는 이 행을 건너뛸 독립 근거가 아니다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b20> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 20 ;
    djr:text "- application orchestration의 원자성·부수효과 순서·중복 방지·실패 처리\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b21> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 21 ;
    djr:text "- framework와 무관한 도메인 불변식·상태 전이·판정 경계\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b22> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 22 ;
    djr:text "- 현재 DB constraint·transaction·rollback·race·멱등성·repository round-trip\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b23> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 23 ;
    djr:text "- boundary adapter의 변환·정규화·fallback·known failure 번역\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b24> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 24 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-3450 ;
    djr:text "- 별도 사용자 승인 근거 또는 실제 deployed consumer evidence 중 하나가 확인된 공개 Python 계약\n- composition root 의 **실배선 정합** — 진짜 `build_<use_case>()` 가 실 어댑터에 꽂는 callable 의 시그니처 일치(fake 는 프로세스 밖 경계뿐) · 팩토리를 통째 monkeypatch 한 테스트는 이 대상의 보호가 아니다\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b25> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 25 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2156 ;
    djr:text "다음 항목은 그 자체로 영구 테스트 자격이 아니다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b26> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 26 ;
    djr:text "- Python·Django·Pydantic·Django Ninja 등 framework/stdlib의 기본 동작\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b27> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 27 ;
    djr:text "- Pydantic validator 배치·`ValidationError.loc`, private helper·module 배치, production source AST/import 형태\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b28> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 28 ;
    djr:text "- production docstring·slots·monkeypatch seam·nominal inheritance만 확인하는 assertion\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b29> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 29 ;
    djr:text "- 테스트 도구 호환을 위해 만든 production 의미\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "| candidate | protected contract/evidence | unique production failure | existing authoritative coverage | decision | owner/path |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b30> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 30 ;
    djr:text "- import 가능 여부나 loader 성공만 확인하는 availability test\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b31> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 31 ;
    djr:text "- quota·coverage·피라미드 비율·디버깅 편의만을 이유로 한 테스트 복제\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b32> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 32 ;
    djr:text "- migration 파일·함수·과거 state·적용 순서 자체를 oracle로 삼는 테스트\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b33> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 33 ;
    djr:text "- `.dddjango` 문서를 읽거나 파싱해 통과하는 제품 pytest\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b34> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 34 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2157, djr:R-2158, djr:R-2159, djr:R-2160 ;
    djr:text "형식이 meta/introspection이라는 이유만으로 모든 테스트를 금지하지 않는다. 공개 Python exact field·signature·exception hierarchy는 **별도 사용자 승인 근거 또는 실제 deployed consumer evidence 중 하나**가 있으면 입장 심사를 통과할 수 있으며 둘 다 요구하지 않는다. 두 근거가 충돌하거나 어느 쪽도 명확하지 않을 때만 `pending`이다. 반대로 내부 Schema·helper를 직접 호출하는 introspection은 공개 wire를 대신하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b35> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 35 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2161, djr:R-2162, djr:R-2163, djr:R-2164, djr:R-2165 ;
    djr:text "중복은 **계약 + boundary + failure mechanism**을 함께 비교하되, boundary 차이만으로 `add`하지 않는다. 기존 권위 테스트가 다른 boundary에서라도 같은 제품 failure를 잡고 후보가 독자적인 failure mechanism을 제시하지 못하면 `reuse`다. 상위 테스트에서 버그를 발견했다는 이유만으로 같은 failure를 unit test로 자동 복제하지 않는다. domain 판정·application orchestration·DB race/constraint·adapter 변환·HTTP 직렬화처럼 층이 달라도 failure mechanism이 독립적일 때만 각각 `add`할 수 있다. 테스트를 나누는 행위는 가독성 recipe일 뿐 새 case의 입장 근거가 아니다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b36> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 36 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2166, djr:R-2167 ;
    djr:text "이번 실행의 Red만 위해 만든 `find_spec`·동적 import guard·대체 decorator·skip/xfail·loader helper는 만든 역할이 해당 surface의 첫 Green 직후 제거한다. 정상 import와 실제 행동 assertion만 남기며, 작업 전부터 있던 비계를 이번 실행이 만들었다고 간주해 임의 삭제하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b37> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 37 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2168, djr:R-2169, djr:R-2170 ;
    djr:text "현재 계약에는 현재 도메인 불변식과 명시적 부재 의무뿐 아니라 지원 중인 구 API, 이미 저장된 데이터, 이미 발행된 이벤트, 보안·개인정보·규제 의무가 포함된다. 과거 버그에서 태어났어도 이 중 하나를 계속 검증하면 유효한 회귀 테스트다. 반대로 유일한 유지 근거가 과거 구현·종료된 계약·버그 번호·“예전에는 이랬다”뿐이면 history-only 테스트다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b38> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 38 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2171, djr:R-2172, djr:R-2173 ;
    djr:text "새 명세의 **침묵은 종료 승인이 아니다**. 관련 표면의 의무 종료는 승인된 설계에 명시되고, 해당 표면에 적용 가능한 support·deprecation/Sunset·rollout·영속 데이터/이벤트 호환성 근거가 있어야 한다. 충돌하거나 불명확하면 `pending`으로 설계에 반송하며, 테스트 삭제·assertion 약화와 구현 완료를 막는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b39> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 39 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2174 ;
    djr:text "승인된 변경 계약을 직접 단언하거나 변경 코드 경로를 직접 검증하는 관련 테스트만 다음처럼 조정한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b40> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 40 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2175 ;
    djr:text "- 현재 계약과 기대가 같으면 유지한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b41> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 41 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2176 ;
    djr:text "- 의무는 유지되지만 승인된 입력·결과가 바뀌었으면 해당 assertion/test를 갱신해 올바른 Red를 확인한다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b42> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 42 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2177, djr:R-2178 ;
    djr:text "- 현행 assertion과 종료 assertion이 섞였으면 현행 보장을 남기도록 분리하거나 부분 갱신한다. 파일 전체를 지우지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b43> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 43 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2179, djr:R-2180 ;
    djr:text "- 모든 기대가 명시적으로 종료됐으면 테스트를 삭제한다. 부재 자체가 계약이 아니면 관성적인 404·필드 부재 테스트를 대신 만들지 않는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b44> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 44 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2181 ;
    djr:text "- 현재 구현만 계약과 다르면 테스트를 유지하고 구현을 고친다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b45> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 45 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2182 ;
    djr:text "- 전체 suite에서 실패했다는 사실만으로 관련 테스트나 편집 대상으로 넓히지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b46> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 46 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2183, djr:R-2184, djr:R-2185, djr:R-2186 ;
    djr:text "Django migration 파일·번호·dependency graph·operation·적용 순서·과거 model state·forward/reverse·DDL 자체가 오라클인 migration 전용 테스트는 만들지 않는다 — 절대 규칙이다. `migrations/`는 `makemigrations`가 생성한 산출물이라 테스트 대상이 아니며, 기존에 있던 migration 전용 테스트도 기대와 무관하게 삭제한다(`check-test-config` #637이 `django.db.migrations`·`MigrationExecutor`류·migration 모듈 import 신호로 결정적으로 잡는다 — 2026-08-25). 새 migration 시나리오·coverage가 필요해야만 검증 가능한 부분은 테스트를 발명하지 않고 검증 공백으로 보고한다. 기술적 식별 예시는 `implementation-test` §1.4를 따른다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b47> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 47 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2187, djr:R-2188 ;
    djr:text "현재 model·ORM·service·API·DB constraint를 검증하는 DB-backed 테스트는 migration history가 오라클이 아니므로 허용한다. migration 구현·rollout/backfill·이력 보존과 migration 검증 공백을 현재 model 테스트가 대신 증명한다고 주장하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b48> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 48 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2137 ;
    djr:text "- `protected contract/evidence`: 승인된 요구·설계·지원 근거 또는 실제 consumer와 보호할 관찰 의미를 적는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2138 ;
    djr:text "- `unique production failure`: 이 테스트가 없을 때 놓치는 구체적인 production failure를 적는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2139 ;
    djr:text "- `existing authoritative coverage`: 같은 계약을 보호하는 기존 권위 테스트의 경로·case 또는 없음을 적는다.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2140 ;
    djr:text "- `owner/path`: decision을 수행할 역할과 편집·검증 대상을 적는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2141 ;
    djr:text "`decision`은 다음 일곱 값으로 완결한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s027-6.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 6.1 가짜로 구현하기 (Fake It)"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s027-6.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s027-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2189, djr:R-2190 ;
    djr:text "\n`add/update`로 승인된 실패 테스트를 만든 후 첫 번째 구현은 **상수를 반환**하게 하여 일단 통과시킨다. 그 후 상수를 변수를 사용하는 수식으로 변경한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s027-6.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s027-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# 단계 1: 상수 반환\ndef summary(run_count, fail_count):\n    return \"1 run, 0 failed\"\n\n# 단계 2: 일부 변수화\ndef summary(run_count, fail_count):\n    return f\"{run_count} run, 0 failed\"\n\n# 단계 3: 완전한 구현\ndef summary(run_count, fail_count):\n    return f\"{run_count} run, {fail_count} failed\"\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s027-6.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s027-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "두 가지 효과:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s027-6.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s027-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "- **심리학적 효과**: 초록 막대 상태에서 확신을 갖고 리팩토링할 수 있다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s027-6.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s027-6.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "- **범위 조절**: 하나의 구체적인 예에서 시작해서 일반화하면 쓸데없는 고민으로 혼동하는 일을 예방한다\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s028-6.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 6.2 삼각측량 (Triangulation)"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "6.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s028-6.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s028-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2191 ;
    djr:text "\n추상화 과정을 테스트로 주도할 때 최대한 보수적으로 하는 방법: **예가 두 개 이상일 때에만 추상화**한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s028-6.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s028-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\ndef test_plus():\n    assert plus(3, 1) == 4\n    assert plus(3, 4) == 7  # 두 번째 예에서 추상화\n\n\ndef plus(a, b):\n    return a + b  # 두 예제가 있으므로 비로소 일반화\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s028-6.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s028-6.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2192 ;
    djr:text "어떻게 올바르게 추상화할 것인지 감잡기 어려울 때 사용하면 좋다.\n\n"@ko .

