    djr:text "- **팀 프로그래밍**: 테스트가 성공한 상태로 끝마친다\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s037-7.7/b3> a djr:Block ;
