<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s040-9.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 9.1 이중 루프 TDD (Double Loop TDD)"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "9.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s040-9.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s040-9.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b2> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2212 ;
    djr:text "\n\"Growing Object-Oriented Software, Guided by Tests\"의 핵심 개념. 바깥 루프(인수 테스트)와 안쪽 루프(단위 테스트)는 서로 다른 피드백 범위를 제공하지만, 이중 루프라는 이유만으로 같은 계약의 양쪽 테스트가 자동 의무가 되지는 않는다. 각 영구 테스트 후보는 §5.5를 통과해야 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s040-9.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s040-9.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```\n+---------------------------------------------------+\n|  바깥 루프: 인수 테스트 (Acceptance Test)            |\n|  RED -> (아직 기능이 없으므로 실패)                   |\n|                                                     |\n|   +-------------------------------------------+    |\n|   |  안쪽 루프: 단위 테스트 (Unit Test)          |    |\n|   |  RED -> GREEN -> REFACTOR (반복)            |    |\n|   +-------------------------------------------+    |\n|                                                     |\n|  GREEN -> (단위 테스트를 충분히 통과시키면            |\n|            인수 테스트도 통과한다)                    |\n+---------------------------------------------------+\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s040-9.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s040-9.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# === 바깥 루프: 인수 테스트 (End-to-End) ===\ndef test_acceptance_user_registration(client):\n    \"\"\"전체 시스템을 블랙박스로 취급한다.\"\"\"\n    response = client.post(\"/register\", json={\n        \"email\": \"new@example.com\",\n        \"password\": \"secure123\",\n    })\n    assert response.status_code == 201\n\n    # 실제로 로그인이 되는지 확인\n    login_response = client.post(\"/login\", json={\n        \"email\": \"new@example.com\",\n        \"password\": \"secure123\",\n    })\n    assert login_response.status_code == 200\n\n\n# === 안쪽 루프: 단위 테스트 (Mock 사용) ===\ndef test_registration_service_saves_user(mocker):\n    \"\"\"서비스 계층이 repository에 올바르게 저장하는지 확인.\"\"\"\n    mock_repo = mocker.Mock()\n    mock_hasher = mocker.Mock()\n    mock_hasher.hash.return_value = \"hashed_pw\"\n\n    service = RegistrationService(mock_repo, mock_hasher)\n    service.register(\"new@example.com\", \"secure123\")\n\n    mock_repo.save.assert_called_once()\n    saved_user = mock_repo.save.call_args[0][0]\n    assert saved_user[\"email\"] == \"new@example.com\"\n    assert saved_user[\"password\"] == \"hashed_pw\"\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s041-9.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 9.2 Walking Skeleton [Freeman & Pryce - GOOS]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "9.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s041-9.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s041-9.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2213 ;
    djr:text "\nGOOS의 첫 번째 단계: **가장 얇은 슬라이스의 실제 기능**을 구현하여 빌드, 배포, 테스트가 끝까지(end-to-end) 동작하는 것을 확인한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s041-9.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s041-9.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2214, djr:R-2215 ;
    djr:text "Walking Skeleton은 import 가능 여부·loader 성공만 확인하는 availability test가 아니다. 실제로 관찰 가능한 얇은 end-to-end 행동이 있을 때만 영구 테스트 후보가 된다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s041-9.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s041-9.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# Walking Skeleton: 최소한의 end-to-end 경로\n\n# 1. 공개 E2E 행동이 add/update로 입장된 경우 가장 단순한 인수 테스트 작성\ndef test_walking_skeleton_health_check(client):\n    \"\"\"시스템이 기동되어 응답할 수 있는지 확인하는 가장 얇은 슬라이스.\"\"\"\n    response = client.get(\"/health\")\n    assert response.status_code == 200\n    assert response.json()[\"status\"] == \"ok\"\n\n# 이 테스트가 통과하려면:\n# - 웹 서버 기동\n# - 라우팅 설정\n# - 응답 직렬화\n# - 테스트 인프라 (클라이언트 fixture)\n# 위의 모든 것이 동작해야 한다 -> 아키텍처 결정을 강제한다\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s042-9.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 9.3 Mock Roles, Not Objects [Freeman, Pryce, Mackinnon, Walnes -- OOPSLA 2004]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "9.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s042-9.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s042-9.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2216, djr:R-2217, djr:R-2218 ;
    djr:text "\nMock의 대상은 구체적인 객체가 아니라 **역할(Role)** 이다. 프로덕션 코드는 구체 구현 클래스(예: `StripeGateway`, `SmtpSender`)가 아니라 역할(인터페이스)에 의존하고, 테스트는 그 역할을 Mock한다. 역할을 `Protocol`로 정의하고 `mocker.Mock(spec=...)`로 대체하는 구체 구현은 작성법이므로 `implementation-test` §7을 따른다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s043-9.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 9.4 Tell, Don't Ask 원칙 [Freeman & Pryce - GOOS]"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "9.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s043-9.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s043-9.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2219 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"객체에게 정보를 요청해서 우리가 답을 계산하지 말고, 우리가 진짜 원하는 것을 객체에게 말하라(Tell).\"\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s043-9.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s043-9.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# --- 나쁨: Ask (정보를 가져와서 외부에서 판단) ---\nclass BadOrderProcessor:\n    def process(self, order):\n        if order.get_status() == \"pending\":\n            if order.get_total() > 0:\n                order.set_status(\"confirmed\")\n                self.notifier.send(order.get_email(), \"확인됨\")\n\n\n# --- 좋음: Tell (객체에게 행위를 위임) ---\nclass GoodOrderProcessor:\n    def process(self, order):\n        order.confirm(self.notifier)  # 객체에게 \"확인하라\"고 말한다\n\n\nclass Order:\n    def confirm(self, notifier):\n        \"\"\"주문 스스로가 확인 로직을 수행한다.\"\"\"\n        if self.status == \"pending\" and self.total > 0:\n            self.status = \"confirmed\"\n            notifier.send(self.email, \"확인됨\")\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s043-9.4/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s043-9.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s045-10.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 10.1 값 객체 (Value Object)"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "10.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s045-10.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s045-10.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2220 ;
    djr:text "\n객체가 생성된 이후 그 값이 절대 변하지 않게 하여 별칭 문제가 발생하지 않게 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s045-10.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s045-10.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass Money:\n    amount: int\n    currency: str\n\n    def plus(self, other: \"Money\") -> \"Money\":\n        assert self.currency == other.currency\n        return Money(self.amount + other.amount, self.currency)\n\n\ndef test_money_immutable():\n    five = Money(5, \"USD\")\n    ten = five.plus(Money(5, \"USD\"))\n    assert ten == Money(10, \"USD\")\n    assert five == Money(5, \"USD\")  # 원본 불변\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s046-10.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 10.2 널 객체 (Null Object)"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "10.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s046-10.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s046-10.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2221 ;
    djr:text "\n특별한 상황을 표현하는 새로운 객체를 만들어, 다른 정상적인 상황을 나타내는 객체와 동일한 프로토콜을 제공한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s046-10.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s046-10.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nclass SecurityManager:\n    def can_write(self, path: str) -> None:\n        # 권한 검사 로직\n        ...\n\n\nclass LaxSecurity:\n    \"\"\"널 객체: 보안 검사를 하지 않는 SecurityManager\"\"\"\n    def can_write(self, path: str) -> None:\n        pass  # 항상 허용\n\n\ndef get_security_manager() -> SecurityManager:\n    if _security is None:\n        return LaxSecurity()  # null 대신 널 객체 반환\n    return _security\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s047-10.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 10.3 팩토리 메서드 (Factory Method)"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "10.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s047-10.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s047-10.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2222 ;
    djr:text "\n생성자를 쓰는 대신 일반 메서드에서 객체를 생성하여 유연성을 확보한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s047-10.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s047-10.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nclass Money:\n    @staticmethod\n    def dollar(amount: int) -> \"Money\":\n        return Money(amount, \"USD\")\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def franc(amount: int) -> \"Money\":\n        return Money(amount, \"CHF\")\n\n\ndef test_multiplication():\n    five = Money.dollar(5)\n    assert five.times(2) == Money.dollar(10)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s047-10.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s047-10.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s049-11.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.1 차이점 일치시키기"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s049-11.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s049-11.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2223, djr:R-2224 ;
    djr:text "\n비슷해 보이는 두 코드 조각을 합치려면, 두 코드가 **단계적으로 닮아가게끔 수정**한다. 완전히 동일해지면 둘을 합친다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s050-11.2> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.2 변화 격리하기"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.2" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s050-11.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s050-11.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2225 ;
    djr:text "\n객체나 메서드의 일부만 바꾸려면, 일단 바꿔야 할 부분을 격리한다. 격리 방법에는 **메서드 추출하기**, 객체 추출하기, 메서드 객체 등이 있다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.3 데이터 이주시키기"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.3" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2226 ;
    djr:text "\n표현 양식을 변경하려면 **일시적으로 데이터를 중복**시킨다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "내부에서 외부로의 변화 단계:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2227 ;
    djr:text "1. 새로운 포맷의 인스턴스 변수를 추가한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2228 ;
    djr:text "2. 기존 포맷의 인스턴스 변수를 세팅하는 모든 부분에서 새로운 인스턴스 변수도 세팅하게 만든다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2229 ;
    djr:text "3. 기존 변수를 사용하는 모든 곳에서 새 변수를 사용하게 만든다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2230 ;
    djr:text "4. 기존 포맷을 제거한다\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2231 ;
    djr:text "5. 새 포맷에 맞게 외부 인터페이스를 변경한다\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s051-11.3> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# 단계 1-2: 데이터 중복\nclass TestSuite:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.tests = []\n\n    def add(self, test):\n        self.test = test        # 기존 (곧 제거)\n        self.tests.append(test)  # 신규\n\n    # 단계 3: 새 변수 사용\n    def run(self, result):\n        for test in self.tests:\n            test.run(result)\n\n    # 단계 4: self.test 제거 완료\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s052-11.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.4 메서드 추출하기"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s052-11.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s052-11.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2232 ;
    djr:text "\n길고 복잡한 메서드의 일부분을 **별도의 메서드로 분리**해내고 이를 호출하게 한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s052-11.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s052-11.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# Before\ndef generate_report(data):\n    # 데이터 검증 (20줄)\n    ...\n    # 포맷팅 (30줄)\n    ...\n    # 출력 (10줄)\n    ...\n\n# After\ndef generate_report(data):\n    validated = validate_data(data)\n    formatted = format_report(validated)\n    output_report(formatted)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s053-11.5> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.5 메서드 인라인"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.5" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s053-11.5/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s053-11.5> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2233 ;
    djr:text "\n너무 꼬여있거나 산재한 제어 흐름을 단순화하려면, 메서드를 호출하는 부분을 **호출될 메서드의 본문으로 교체**한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s054-11.6> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.6 인터페이스 추출하기"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.6" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s054-11.6/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s054-11.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2234 ;
    djr:text "\n오퍼레이션에 대한 두 번째 구현을 추가하려면, 공통되는 오퍼레이션을 담고 있는 **인터페이스(Protocol)**를 만든다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s054-11.6/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s054-11.6> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom typing import Protocol\n\n\nclass Repository(Protocol):\n    def get(self, id: int) -> dict: ...\n    def save(self, data: dict) -> None: ...\n\n\nclass PostgresRepository:\n    def get(self, id: int) -> dict: ...\n    def save(self, data: dict) -> None: ...\n\n\nclass InMemoryRepository:\n    \"\"\"테스트용 구현\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._store = {}\n\n    def get(self, id: int) -> dict:\n        return self._store[id]\n\n    def save(self, data: dict) -> None:\n        self._store[data[\"id\"]] = data\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s055-11.7> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.7 메서드 옮기기"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.7" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s055-11.7/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s055-11.7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2235 ;
    djr:text "\n메서드를 원래 있어야 할 장소로 옮기려면, 어울리는 클래스에 메서드를 추가해주고 그것을 호출하게 하라.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s056-11.8> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 11.8 메서드 객체"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "11.8" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s056-11.8/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s056-11.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2236 ;
    djr:text "\n여러 개의 매개 변수와 지역 변수를 갖는 복잡한 메서드를 표현하려면, 메서드를 꺼내서 객체로 만든다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s056-11.8/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s056-11.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 12.1 행위 냄새 (Behavior Smells)"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "12.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n테스트를 실행할 때 발생하는 문제들.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# === Assertion Roulette (나쁨) ===\ndef test_user_creation_roulette():\n    user = create_user(\"홍길동\", \"hong@test.com\", 30)\n    assert user.name == \"홍길동\"       # 이 줄이 실패? 아래 줄이 실패?\n    assert user.email == \"hong@test.com\"\n    assert user.age == 30\n    assert user.is_active is True\n\n\n# === Assertion Roulette 해결: 테스트 분리 ===\ndef test_user_has_correct_name():\n    user = create_user(\"홍길동\", \"hong@test.com\", 30)\n    assert user.name == \"홍길동\"\n\n\ndef test_user_is_active_by_default():\n    user = create_user(\"홍길동\", \"hong@test.com\", 30)\n    assert user.is_active is True\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b35> ;
    djr:text "여기서 분리는 이미 입장한 한 계약을 읽기 쉽게 표현하는 recipe다. 분리 자체가 새 영구 case를 추가할 근거는 아니며, 새 case마다 §5.5의 독자적인 failure 판정이 필요하다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "| 냄새 | 설명 | 해결책 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "|------|------|--------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "| **Assertion Roulette** | 여러 단언 중 어느 것이 실패했는지 알기 어려움 | 각 단언에 메시지 추가, 테스트 분리 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "| **Erratic Test** | 같은 코드인데 때로 성공, 때로 실패 | 공유 상태 제거, 테스트 격리 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "| **Fragile Test** | 관련 없는 코드 변경에도 깨짐 | 구현이 아닌 행위에 대해 테스트 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:text "| **Frequent Debugging** | 테스트 실패 시 원인을 디버깅해야만 알 수 있음 | 테스트를 작게, 단언을 명확하게 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:text "| **Slow Test** | 전체 테스트 실행이 수 분~수 시간 소요 | 외부 의존성 제거, 병렬 실행 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s058-12.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:text "| **Manual Intervention** | 테스트 실행에 사람의 수동 개입 필요 | 완전 자동화 |\n\n" .

