<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 16.1 TDD와 BDD의 관계"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "16.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\nBDD는 TDD의 **진화형**이다. TDD가 개발자 중심의 코드 정확성에 집중한다면, BDD는 비즈니스 요구사항을 자연어로 표현하여 이해관계자와의 소통을 중시한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2240 ;
    djr:text "pytest-bdd 구현 상세는 `implementation-test` 스킬을 참조한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "```\nTDD 진화 경로:\nTDD (코드 정확성) -> ATDD (인수 테스트) -> BDD (행위 명세 + 소통)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "| 구분 | TDD | BDD |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "|------|-----|-----|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "| 관점 | 개발자 중심 | 사용자/비즈니스 중심 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "| 명세 언어 | 프로그래밍 언어 | 자연어 (Gherkin) |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:text "| 테스트 단위 | 함수/클래스 | 시나리오/행위 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:text "| 산출물 | 단위 테스트 | 살아있는 문서(living documentation) |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s064-16.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:text "| 참여자 | 개발자 | 개발자 + 기획자 + QA |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s066-17.1> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 17.1 TDD as Prompt Engineering"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "17.1" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s066-17.1/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s066-17.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n> \"TDD는 프롬프트 엔지니어링이다. 테스트가 AI에게 '무엇을' 만들고 '언제 완료인지'를 알려준다.\"\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s066-17.1/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s066-17.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b2> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2241, djr:R-2242 ;
    djr:text "§5.5에서 `add/update`로 입장된 테스트에는 TDD의 Red-Green-Refactor 사이클을 AI 코딩 도구와 결합할 수 있다. 기능 요구나 AI 위험 자체가 새 영구 테스트를 자동 승인하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s066-17.1/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s066-17.1> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "```\n전통 TDD:     입장 결정 -> 개발자가 승인 테스트 작성 -> 개발자가 구현\nAI 보조 TDD:  입장 결정 -> 개발자가 승인 테스트 작성 -> AI가 구현 제안 -> 개발자가 검증\nTDAID:        Plan -> Admission -> Red -> Green(AI) -> Refactor(AI+개발자) -> Validate\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s069-17.4> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "### 17.4 dddjango Admission을 추가한 TDAID 6단계"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "17.4" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s069-17.4/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s069-17.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s025-5.5/b2> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2243, djr:R-2244, djr:R-2245, djr:R-2246, djr:R-2247, djr:R-2248 ;
    djr:text "\n```\n1. Plan      : 기능 요구사항에서 테스트 candidate를 도출\n2. Admission : 계약·독자 failure·기존 coverage로 decision 확정\n3. Red       : `add/update`로 승인된 실패 테스트 작성\n4. Green     : 테스트를 통과하는 구현 (AI 보조)\n5. Refactor  : 코드 품질 개선 (AI + 개발자 협업)\n6. Validate  : AI 생성 코드의 정확성, 보안, 성능 최종 검증\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s069-17.4/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/discipline-tdd/references/final.md/s069-17.4> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

